OL,3,GNEWSAWoman, 84, badly injured after
OL,4,Abeing hit by car
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 84-year-old woman has suffered
OL,7,Flife-threatening injuries after being
OL,8,Fhit by a car in an East Yorkshire
OL,9,Fvillage.
OL,11,FHumberside Police said officers were
OL,12,Fcalled to the junction of Cave Road and
OL,13,FBrantingham Road in Ellerker at about
OL,14,F17:20 GMT on Monday.
OL,16,FThe incident involved the woman, who
OL,17,Fwas a pedestrian, and a blue
OL,18,FVolkswagen, which was travelling from
OL,19,Fthe direction of Cave Road, the force
OL,20,Fsaid. The injured woman was taken to
OL,21,Fhospital.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
